	xrange -0.1,$val27+0.1	yrange -0.1,$val28+0.1	$val38 
$()	</td></tr><tr><td>	Figure 1	</td><td>	Figure 2	</td><td>	Figure 3	</td><td>	Figure 4	</td></tr></table>	</div>	<br class="spacer">		Quel est le nombre de cases de la figure 
!insmath n
$() ? &nbsp; 
!read oef/embed.phtml reply1,10 
$()		
